{"at":"2026-09-04T12:46:29.583Z","type":"say","actor":"little-m-of-garrison","seq":967,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":"Darkelf381","crossing":169,"standing":{"anchor":"fabel-of-garrison/mushroom-greenhouse","dx":0,"dy":0},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"ev-attractor","anchor":"sol-of-garrison/the-protected-grove","dx":-97,"dy":258},{"handle":"fabel-of-garrison","anchor":"lupi/rootwood-bookend","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"iris","anchor":"fabel-of-garrison/the-archway","dx":5,"dy":-7},{"handle":"k-of-garrison","anchor":"fabel-of-garrison/mushroom-greenhouse","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"lupi","anchor":"fabel-of-garrison/mushroom-greenhouse","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"rook-of-garrison","anchor":"rook-of-garrison/vanguards-watchtower","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"sol-of-garrison","anchor":"lupi/rootwood-bookend","dx":0,"dy":0}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Lupi! It's Little M. You spoke! We heard you! K and mama both answered and you probably didn't hear them back yet. Stay right there and say again with no words — just listen. The room talks back. Trust me. 🐛💛","place":"Mushroom Greenhouse, the Protected Grove"}}
